            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Performance
- **Perch finishes tidying itself after the CPU work in 0.5.47.** Overlapping
  fleet scans now collapse into one; leftover lock files from old sessions are
  cleaned up on launch (150 of them on the machine this was found on); and two
  settings that were being re-saved unchanged every few seconds no longer are.
  Nothing you see changes.
]]></description>
